  "details": "I believe this is actually a bug with finalIK itself that can be solved, or at least reduced by setting VRIK.solver.spine.bodyRotStiffness to 0 or near 0, or increasing VRIK.solver.spine.maintainPelvisPosition, or (best solution IMO but more effort), estimating the position/rotation of the hip and feeding it into the solver as a \"tracked point\"\n\nOr just wait for standable FBE dev tools and implement that since it solves not only this issue but several others with 3pt tracking as well.\n\nUpdate: added additional gifs of various avatars having this issue, mostly to prove this isn't an avatar specific issue.",
